---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="Leadership | Professor Iain Rice">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Leadership" title="Academic, organisational and AI transformation leadership." lede="A track record of leading people, programmes and AI systems in complex, regulated and diverse environments." />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container grid-2">
      <div class="card"><h3>Birmingham City University</h3><p>Professor of Industrial AI, Professor of AI and Head of Teaching & Learning. Leading teaching and learning activity, supervising applied AI research, directing consultancy projects and leading a team of over 100 academic staff.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Strategic AI leadership</h3><p>Managed projects from £55k to over £3m with multiple stakeholders and regulatory reporting mechanisms. Designed and managed a conversion MSc Artificial Intelligence course attracting over 2000 applications in three years.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>External advisory roles</h3><p>Chief Data Scientist with Our Safer City, working alongside City of London Police on predictive analytics and dashboards to help prevent violence against women and girls.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>FinTech and education innovation</h3><p>AI Advisor to Figg Wealth on AI strategy, LLM integration and predictive analytics. Head of Content with Bot Theory, developing bite-size education activities in web-3.0 enabled game environments.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section dark"><div class="container">
    <h2>Previous leadership</h2>
    <p>At Arden University, led Computing & IT with a £4m budget line and 40 staff internationally, growing Data MSc offerings to net £1m annually within two years and developing apprenticeship offerings across technology and management disciplines.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="quote-card">
        <blockquote>"From our first meeting with Iain, it was clear he understood how companies and consultancy worked, and how best to interact with us. His ability to grasp the value held in our data and how it is used allowed him to explain why the solution to our problems was not merely an AI application, as others had insinuated, but rather a problem of data visualisation. The quick turn-around and business-focussed approach was not what we had come to expect from an academic institution and should be templated in other areas."</blockquote>
        <cite>— Stuart Ewen, CEO of Mindset Associates</cite>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-banner">
      <h2>Interested in a conversation?</h2>
      <p>I'd love to discuss how I can support your organisation's AI journey.</p>
      <a class="btn" href={`${base}/contact/`}>Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
